#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0312 expect=skipped domain=ADMH
#note "DISCRIMINATING FIXTURE for finding AD0312-F2 - pinned exactly as authored, not re-aimed. No class/structure/subclass key. MHDECOD ends with DECOD -> OCCURRENCE DATA STRUCTURE (Data_Structures gate satisfied), but AdamSubclassDetector's ADVERSE EVENT branch is a literal test for a column named AEDECOD or AETERM, which this dataset lacks - no subclass is detected, so Subclasses.Include rejects it. Data would fire if the rule ran. If the decision lane drops the Subclasses block, this file flips to violation/count 1/row=1 variable_name=SMQ01SC USUBJID=01-701-1015."
#library standard=adamig version=1-1
dataset ADMH
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col MHDECOD  type=Char
col SMQ01NAM type=Char
col SMQ01SC  type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HYPERTENSION | CARDIACDISORDERS | WIDE
